"Bypass the safety check that refuses to load an MLX model when free RAM looks too low for its weights plus warmup headroom. The check is conservative — macOS reclaims file cache as the model loads — so turn this on if a load you know fits is being refused. A genuine over-commit can hard-crash the server. Passes --skip-mem-preflight." = "绕过安全检查：当可用内存看起来不足以容纳模型权重加上预热余量时，该检查会拒绝加载 MLX 模型。这个检查偏保守 —— macOS 会在模型加载过程中回收文件缓存 —— 所以如果你确定某个加载可以装下却被拒绝，就打开它。真正的过度占用可能让服务器直接崩溃。会传递 --skip-mem-preflight。";
