"DeepSeek‑V4‑Flash ships its own 3‑stage speculative draft (DSpark). Enabling it loads about 11 GB of extra draft weights at startup, so it stays off unless you turn it on — and the server still refuses when the Mac doesn't have the memory for model + draft + working room, serving normally instead. For DeepSeek‑V4 GGUF files this arms the embedded ds4 engine's DSpark runtime instead, using the DSpark support GGUF downloaded beside the model (nothing happens without that file). Only affects DeepSeek‑V4 models; greedy (temperature 0) requests only." = "DeepSeek‑V4‑Flash 自带 3 阶段的投机草稿（DSpark）。启用后会在启动时额外加载约 11 GB 的草稿权重，所以除非你主动开启，它都保持关闭 —— 而当这台 Mac 没有足够内存容纳模型 + 草稿 + 工作余量时，服务器仍会拒绝启用，转而正常提供服务。对于 DeepSeek‑V4 的 GGUF 文件，这改为启用内置 ds4 引擎的 DSpark 运行时，并使用随模型一同下载的 DSpark 支持 GGUF（没有该文件则不会有任何效果）。仅影响 DeepSeek‑V4 模型；且仅限贪心（temperature 0）请求。";
