"Free a model's memory once it has served nothing for this long; the next request reloads it. Off by default. Turn it on when something else needs the RAM between sessions. The trade is paid on the next request: a cold load (seconds to a minute for a large model) plus a full re-prefill of the conversation, and if the memory is gone by then the reload is refused and that request fails. A model with a request in flight is never evicted. Passes --idle-evict-secs." = "当模型在这段时间内没有处理任何请求后就释放它的内存；下一次请求会重新加载它。默认关闭。当其他程序在会话间隔期间需要这些内存时再开启。代价要到下一次请求才付出：一次冷加载（大模型需要数秒到一分钟）外加对整段对话的完整重新预填充；如果到那时内存已被占用，重新加载会被拒绝，该请求随即失败。有请求正在处理的模型永远不会被换出。会传递 --idle-evict-secs。";
