"Guidance strength — how closely the video follows your prompt. 1.0 = off: fastest and most natural-looking. Higher sticks to the prompt more strictly but is slower and can look over-saturated. LTX default is 3.0." = "引导强度 —— 视频跟随提示词的紧密程度。1.0 = 关闭：最快，画面也最自然。数值越高，贴合提示词越严格，但速度更慢，画面可能过饱和。LTX 默认为 3.0。";
