"Hands-free voice assistant — talk to the model with no chat window required. Speech-to-text and text-to-speech run locally on your Mac. When this popover is closed, feedback is audio-only; reopen it for status and controls." = "免提语音助手 —— 无需聊天窗口即可与模型对话。语音转文字与文字转语音都在你的 Mac 本地运行。关闭此浮出窗口后只有语音反馈；重新打开可查看状态与控件。";
