"Privacy: prompts sent to a model you share are processed on — and visible to — this Mac. Prompts you send to a network model are visible to the Mac hosting it. Traffic stays on your local network, and everything here is off unless you turn it on." = "隐私：发送给你所共享模型的提示词会在这台 Mac 上处理，并对它可见。你发送给网络模型的提示词对托管该模型的 Mac 可见。流量始终停留在你的局域网内，这里的一切功能在你开启之前都是关闭的。";
