"Queue depth for in-flight chat requests. Concurrent requests always decode together; whether they share one forward pass depends on the loaded model (shown below). Dense and Qwen3.5/3.8 models batch, other MoE and hybrid models take turns." = "在处理中的聊天请求的队列深度。并发请求始终一起解码；它们是否共用一次前向传递取决于所加载的模型（见下方）。稠密模型和 Qwen3.5/3.8 模型会批处理，其他 MoE 模型和混合模型则轮流处理。";
